                "custom_liquid": "<div style=\"display:grid;gap:7px;margin-top:2px;\">{%- unless closest.product.metafields.custom.is_package.value -%}<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:0.8125rem;line-height:1.6;opacity:0.72;\"><strong>Per A5 sheet</strong> — 0.75\" ≈50 · 1\" ≈36 · 1.25\" ≈20 · 1.5\" ≈16 · 2\" ≈6 · 2.5\" ≈4 stickers. The exact count shifts a little with your photo's ratio. <a href=\"#es-sizes\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;\">See every size on the sheet</a></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:0.8125rem;line-height:1.6;opacity:0.72;\"><strong>Mixed</strong> — one sheet with a spread of sizes across the range, instead of a single size repeated.</p>{%- endunless -%}<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:0.8125rem;line-height:1.6;opacity:0.72;\"><strong>Material</strong> — White Matte is soft and paper-like, Translucent is semi-clear, Silver and Gold are reflective metallics. All four are laminated and waterproof.</p></div>"
