                  "blocks": {
                    "text_YzHXbm": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<ul><li><strong>White Matte</strong> — soft, paper-like finish. Best for diaries, journals, and indoor packaging.</li><li><strong>Translucent</strong> — semi-clear finish that lets the surface show through. Best for glass, windows, and layered looks on light surfaces.</li><li><strong>Silver</strong> — metallic silver finish. Reflective accent for waterproof use.</li><li><strong>Gold</strong> — metallic gold finish. Reflective accent for waterproof use.</li></ul><p>Printed on inkjet stock and laminated with a premium sheet. All four are laminated, waterproof, and fade resistant.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
